            <ArticleTitle>Endometriosis: still tough to diagnose and treat.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>647-53</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Endometriosis is a chronic disease that may have life-altering implications such as chronic pelvic pain and infertility. The following review will familiarize the practicing physician with available therapies to maintain and enhance reproductive potential and control pelvic pain in women with endometriosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
